    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我被押送到审判庭，<br>\n被安排站在类似证人席的地方，<br>\n然后终于给我解开了束缚。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv25_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 48, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "环绕的证人席上，<br>\n已经有11名少女就位。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv25_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 50, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（这里就是，审判庭吗……）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv25_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 52, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "看守正在出入口大门处站岗。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv25_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 54, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "终于，站在扶手上的典狱长开始发言。<br>", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv25_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 56, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Warden.1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 58, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯……首先我要说明一下<br>\n魔女审判的规则。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv25_Warden001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 60, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "经过1小时的辩论之后，<br>\n我会请各位用你们的手机投票，选出你们心中认定的凶手。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv25_Warden002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 62, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "而在投票中被选为魔女的人物，<br>\n会被带到中间的底座处，执行处刑……大概就这样。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv25_Warden003"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
